{"product_id":"an-illustrated-anthology-for-mothers","title":"An Illustrated Anthology for Mothers","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis is the ideal gift for mothers of all ages, to be given by their children, family or friends. Here in this beautifully illustrated little anthology, split into thematic chapters exploring the many aspects of motherhood, are gathered poems by some of our most famous and treasured poets, from \"My Blessed Mother\" by Christina Rossetti to \"Cradle Song\" by Lord Alfred Tennyson, accompanied by delightful and evocative artworks. Including poems from mothers to their children and from children to their mothers, celebrate the joy and many moods of motherhood\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:32 x 156  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Victoria Lyle \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781847863065 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Hardcover \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 320\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44933372444825,"sku":"8RF9781847863065","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6469512e193d1e645f76810d3c992c79.jpg?v=1730471845","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/an-illustrated-anthology-for-mothers","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}